The refactor to make_virtual does not apply to static methods. Since the method is internal static, I cannot make it virtual or public by refactor. I will instead write a test that uses reflection to invoke the internal method AddAzureTableTransactionalStateStorage on IServiceCollection. This will allow me to cover the call to GetRequiredService inside the method.

I will submit a test file that uses reflection to invoke the internal extension method and then asserts the expected registrations.

